# The repo-root package.json / package-lock.json are TRACKED as of 2026-09-09.
# They were ignored while the root package.json was a scratch holder for a one-off
# @aws-sdk install. It now holds the only gated path to production —
#   build -> verify (_internal/qa/check-page-coverage.mjs + check-file-count.mjs) -> wrangler deploy
# — and the wrangler version pin (^4.34.0; >= 4.34.0 is the floor for Cloudflare's
# 100,000-file static-asset limit). Ignoring them means a fresh clone has no
# `npm run deploy` and falls back to bare `wrangler deploy`, which skips both gates.
# Re-adding `/package.json` here silently un-wires the deploy gate. Do not.
/astro/public/feeds/
_internal/.overpass-cache.json
